<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 75,000 T optional wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 75,000 T optional wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has launched a tender for the import of 75,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat for September shipment, European grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
